        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Employer agrees to continue its present practice of granting two (2) ten (10) minute rest periods during the day and swing shifts, respectively. Additional rest periods may be instituted to comply with applicable State and Federal laws after discussions with the Union President.",
