            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Employees will be given as much advance notice as possible of shift changes and of permanent transfers. When an employee is required to change shifts by the Company, the employee will be given at least ten (10) working days advance notice unless such a notice is not possible due to adverse business conditions or any cause beyond the reasonable control of the Company.",
            "block_bbox": [
